{"id":"0d480b0822a231c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md","title":"Iterated Ultrapowers","display":"thm-iterated-ultrapowers — Iterated Ultrapowers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers","aliases":["58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers","Iterated Ultrapowers","Ult$^n$ Construction"],"display":"thm-iterated-ultrapowers — Iterated Ultrapowers","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers</span><span>Iterated Ultrapowers</span><span>Ult<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^n\">\\(^n\\)</span> Construction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-ultrapowers — Iterated Ultrapowers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-huge.md\">../batch18/58-df-huge.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(U,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,L,j,q,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J\">\\(M,N,L,j,q,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J\\)</span> 为元语言类变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\">\\(\\forall^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\)</span> 为类量词。类函数以有序对图编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:M\\to N\">\\(j:M\\to N\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\subseteq M\\times N\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists!y\\in N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\">\\(j\\subseteq M\\times N\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists!y\\in N\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\subseteq(\\omega+1)\\times V\">\\(\\mathcal M\\subseteq(\\omega+1)\\times V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J\\subseteq(\\omega+1)^2\\times V\\times V\">\\(\\mathcal J\\subseteq(\\omega+1)^2\\times V\\times V\\)</span> 编码类族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M(n)=\\{x:\\langle n,x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M\\}\">\\(\\mathcal M(n)=\\{x:\\langle n,x\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J(n,m)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:\\langle n,m,x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathcal J\\}\">\\(\\mathcal J(n,m)=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:\\langle n,m,x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathcal J\\}\\)</span>。这些记号不是把真类放入集合元组。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U,\\vec\\kappa\">\\(\\vec U,\\vec\\kappa\\)</span> 为定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的集合函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\">\\(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^r\">\\(M^r\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的有限集合函数赋值类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a^\\kappa=\\{\\langle\\alpha,a\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\}\">\\(c_a^\\kappa=\\{\\langle\\alpha,a\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 指内部超幂的传递实现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 同时固定常值函数诱导的规范嵌入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的一参数接口用于成员关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassDirectLimit}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassDirectLimit}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}relations}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M,\\\\\n\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\land\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)=g(\\alpha)\\}\\in U,\\\\\n\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\land\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)\\in g(\\alpha)\\}\\in U.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}relations}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M),\\\\\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M,\\\\\n\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\land\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)=g(\\alpha)\\}\\in U,\\\\\n\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\land\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)\\in g(\\alpha)\\}\\in U.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j;M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:M\\to N\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in M^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to\n(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle N,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j;M,N)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:M\\to N\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in M^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to\n(\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle N,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N)\n\\land U,\\kappa\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land q:\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\}\\to N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land q(f)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad[(q(f)=q(g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa))\\land\n(q(f)\\in q(g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa))]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N)\n\\land U,\\kappa\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land q:\\{f\\in V:\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\}\\to N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land q(f)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f,g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,M,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,M,\\kappa)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad[(q(f)=q(g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UltEq}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa))\\land\n(q(f)\\in q(g)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{UltMem}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,g;M,U,\\kappa))]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N;M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}q\\;\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(N;M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}q\\;\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}map}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:M\\to N\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c_a^\\kappa,M,\\kappa)\\land j(a)=q(c_a^\\kappa))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}map}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(j;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:M\\to N\\land\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{UltCollapse}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(q;N,M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathrm{InternalUltFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c_a^\\kappa,M,\\kappa)\\land j(a)=q(c_a^\\kappa))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne A\\subseteq M\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(b\\notin a)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varnothing\\ne A\\subseteq M\\to\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(b\\notin a)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassDirectLimit}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL=\\mathcal M(\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,m):\\mathcal M(n)\\to\\mathcal M(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le k\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,k)=\\mathcal J(m,k)\\circ\\mathcal J(n,m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists n&lt;\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\;(x=\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m&lt;\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal M(m)\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a)=\\mathcal J(m,\\omega)(b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k&lt;\\omega\\;(n,m\\le k\\land\\mathcal J(n,k)(a)=\\mathcal J(m,k)(b)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a)\\in\\mathcal J(m,\\omega)(b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k&lt;\\omega\\;(n,m\\le k\\land\\mathcal J(n,k)(a)\\in\\mathcal J(m,k)(b)))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClassDirectLimit}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL=\\mathcal M(\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}^{\\mathrm{it}}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,m):\\mathcal M(n)\\to\\mathcal M(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le k\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,k)=\\mathcal J(m,k)\\circ\\mathcal J(n,m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\;\\exists n&lt;\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\;(x=\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m&lt;\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal M(m)\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a)=\\mathcal J(m,\\omega)(b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k&lt;\\omega\\;(n,m\\le k\\land\\mathcal J(n,k)(a)=\\mathcal J(m,k)(b)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\mathcal J(n,\\omega)(a)\\in\\mathcal J(m,\\omega)(b)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists k&lt;\\omega\\;(n,m\\le k\\land\\mathcal J(n,k)(a)\\in\\mathcal J(m,k)(b)))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapowers}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J\\;\\exists\\vec U,\\vec\\kappa,Y_U,Y_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,Y_U)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\omega,Y_\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathcal M(0)=V\\land\\vec U(0)=U\\land\\vec\\kappa(0)=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M(n+1);\\mathcal M(n),\\vec U(n),\\vec\\kappa(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal J(n,n+1);\\mathcal M(n+1),\\mathcal M(n),\\vec U(n),\\vec\\kappa(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\vec U(n+1)=\\mathcal J(n,n+1)(\\vec U(n))\\land\\vec\\kappa(n+1)=\\mathcal J(n,n+1)(\\vec\\kappa(n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal J(n,m);\\mathcal M(n),\\mathcal M(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,n)=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le\\ell\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,\\ell)=\\mathcal J(m,\\ell)\\circ\\mathcal J(n,m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassDirectLimit}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M(\\omega);\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapowers}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\mathcal M,\\mathcal J\\;\\exists\\vec U,\\vec\\kappa,Y_U,Y_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,Y_U)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\omega,Y_\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathcal M(0)=V\\land\\vec U(0)=U\\land\\vec\\kappa(0)=\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n&lt;\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ClassUltrapower}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M(n+1);\\mathcal M(n),\\vec U(n),\\vec\\kappa(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ClassUltrapowerMap}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal J(n,n+1);\\mathcal M(n+1),\\mathcal M(n),\\vec U(n),\\vec\\kappa(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\vec U(n+1)=\\mathcal J(n,n+1)(\\vec U(n))\\land\\vec\\kappa(n+1)=\\mathcal J(n,n+1)(\\vec\\kappa(n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le m\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal J(n,m);\\mathcal M(n),\\mathcal M(m))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\le\\omega\\;(\\mathcal J(n,n)=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\mathcal M(n)\\})\\\